# .spun get bomb01 (mame-bomb.sh): BOMB.BIN says it unpacks to 100 bytes but
# inflates to 8 MB. The unzipper must stop as soon as the output passes 100
# bytes, with UNZIP_E_CHECK, not write the 8 MB first, so .spun must end well
# within the run. y at 16 s answers "Install to C:/apps/bomb?". ON ERROR keeps
# BASIC's screen, and the moment .spun ends shows in mame.log as BASIC's
# fetches of $0000 with PPC on line 20, as in spun-drop.scn.in.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
autostart \x90\x8fGO TO 40
autostart .spun -s @HOST@ -p @PORT@ get bomb01
autostart PRINT "SPUNBOMBDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 30
key 16 y
snap 14 17 19 22 25 29
screen 29 Installing to C:/apps/bomb
